{
  "appid": 1003590,
  "name": "Tetris® Effect: Connected",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "Tetris® Effect: Connected是一款让您耳目一新的俄罗斯方块游戏，带给您从未有过的感受——超经典游戏的华丽重制，独特、惊艳、让人欲罢不能。",
  "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/e20a0354706aed00b5fa7c707a714765.poster.avif?t=1774036904\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/e20a0354706aed00b5fa7c707a714765.webm?t=1774036904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/e20a0354706aed00b5fa7c707a714765.mp4?t=1774036904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tetris® Effect: Connected是一款让您耳目一新的俄罗斯方块游戏，带给您从未有过的感受——超经典游戏的华丽重制，独特、惊艳、让人欲罢不能。<br><br>音乐、背景、音效、特效，一切你能想象到的，乃至方块们（Tetriminos）的跳动、起舞、闪烁和爆炸，将与您的操作完美同步。让您忍不住想要一再体验整个游戏的30多个关卡和10多个模式。<br><br>再加跨平台多人游戏模式，让您痛快合作与竞技！<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/4248c232deea79dcded650418ec93140.poster.avif?t=1774036904\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/4248c232deea79dcded650418ec93140.webm?t=1774036904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/4248c232deea79dcded650418ec93140.mp4?t=1774036904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/82fe8954422b7a4dd0147d7bc802c0a1.webp?t=1774036904\" width=20 height=14 /></span> 一个惊喜连连，令人兴奋的单机游戏体验。<br>超过30个不同的关卡,每个都有专属的音乐、音效、视觉风格和背景,并随游玩过程不断发展和变化。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/82fe8954422b7a4dd0147d7bc802c0a1.webp?t=1774036904\" width=20 height=14 /></span> ZONE是专为Tetris Effect: Connected设计的全新机制！<br>全新的 “Zone”机制，玩家可以通过进入 “zone”来冻结时间与暂停方块的下落，或者在千钧一发之际摆脱可能导致游戏结束的棘手情况，或者消除额外的行数来获得更高分数。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/4cf4f59ad9517a0527aa484c5542aaf0.poster.avif?t=1774036904\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/4cf4f59ad9517a0527aa484c5542aaf0.webm?t=1774036904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/4cf4f59ad9517a0527aa484c5542aaf0.mp4?t=1774036904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/82fe8954422b7a4dd0147d7bc802c0a1.webp?t=1774036904\" width=20 height=14 /></span> 跨平台的多人游戏让你与世界各地的玩家一起玩！<br>不同平台上的玩家可以通过新的房间ID功能轻松加入好友匹配房间或轻松进行匹配游戏。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/27275c78f7bcd56f167b292cc60240b7.poster.avif?t=1774036904\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/27275c78f7bcd56f167b292cc60240b7.webm?t=1774036904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/27275c78f7bcd56f167b292cc60240b7.mp4?t=1774036904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/82fe8954422b7a4dd0147d7bc802c0a1.webp?t=1774036904\" width=20 height=14 /></span> 多种多样的竞争与合作模式!<br>新模式包括：“Connected”，三个玩家将组队并连接他们的游戏面盘，共同对抗AI 首领；“Zone Battle”，俄罗斯方块标准的一对一比赛，但有一个变化：时间暂停的Zone机制（首次在《Tetris® Effect: Connected》的单人模式中引入）；以及 “Score Attack”，两个玩家各自为战的对战模式，看谁能获得最佳分数。<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/68877b2fcd03b17833e73d6da071071c.poster.avif?t=1774036904\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/68877b2fcd03b17833e73d6da071071c.webm?t=1774036904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/68877b2fcd03b17833e73d6da071071c.mp4?t=1774036904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003590/extras/82fe8954422b7a4dd0147d7bc802c0a1.webp?t=1774036904\" width=20 height=14 /></span> 加入旁观者模式分享快乐！<br>加入旁观者模式! 旁观者模式可在好友比赛中使用。一个房间最多可以容纳8个人。旁观者可以在比赛中使用表情来活跃气氛。",
